2032;UTR</td><td align="char" char="." rowspan="1" colspan="1">11</td><td align="char" char="." rowspan="1" colspan="1">23</td><td align="char" char="." rowspan="1" colspan="1">47</td><td align="char" char="." rowspan="1" colspan="1">42</td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" rowspan="1"><italic>GC content</italic></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">high</td><td align="char" char="." rowspan="1" colspan="1">19</td><td align="char" char="." rowspan="1" colspan="1">22</td><td align="char" char="." rowspan="1" colspan="1">119</td><td align="char" char="." rowspan="1" colspan="1">76</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">medium</td><td align="char" char="." rowspan="1" colspan="1">32</td><td align="char" char="." rowspan="1" colspan="1">38</td><td align="char" char="." rowspan="1" colspan="1">136</td><td align="char" char="." rowspan="1" colspan="1">119</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">low</td><td align="char" char="." rowspan="1" colspan="1">21</td><td align="char" char="." rowspan="1" colspan="1">31</td><td align="char" char="." rowspan="1" colspan="1">138</td><td align="char" char="." rowspan="1" colspan="1">133</td></tr></tbody></table></table-wrap><table-wrap id="tbl2" position="float"><label>Table 2</label><caption><p>Maximum-likelihood estimates of the scaled selection parameter <italic>&#x003b3;</italic></p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><th valign="bottom" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">GC content category</th><th valign="bottom" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">maximum likelihood <italic>&#x003b3;</italic></th><th valign="bottom" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">maximum log-likelihood</th><th valign="bottom" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">two-unit support limits</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">high</td><td align="char" char="." rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.60</td><td align="char" char="." rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02212;130.38</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">(0.21&#x02013;1.00)</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">medium</td><td align="char" char="." rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.20</td><td align="char" char="." rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02212;176.19</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">(&#x02212;0.16&#x02013;0.54)</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">low</td><td align="char" char="." rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.05</td><td align="char" char="." rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02212;187.80</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">(&#x02212;0.35&#x02013;0.38)</td></tr></tbody></table></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>